      "type": "stat",
      "title": "herdr up",
      "description": "aether_herdr_up: 1 if the herdr server answered `herdr agent list` this scrape. This covers ONLY herdr \u2014 not T3, not the A2A gateway, not litellm. Note herdr only ever sees herdr-attached panes; a harness run outside herdr (bare ssh, cron, a T3 thread) is invisible to it, but that blind spot doesn't affect this up/down check itself. Healthy = green 1. Red 0 or no data = herdr did not answer.",
